I would appreciate some information about our 
possible participation in Penguicon 2010.

1) Are we committed to particpating?

2) If yes, with what objectives (recruitment, socializing, whatever)?

3) What will we be doing there? (In particular, is there any chance 
of recording a real live conversation in Lojban - as was done some 
years ago?)

4) How will we promote our participation on the Penguicon website?

5) Whom should anybody who is interested contact for more info?
(I mean people interested but not currently committed to Lojban).

